  "steps": [
    "In a Pan, add 1 tsp olive oil. Then add garlic. Sauté for a minute and add onions.",
    "⁠Then finely chop the tempeh cubes and add it to the pan. Cook it for 2-3 mins so that it absorbs the flavors.",
    "⁠Next add all the veggies. Add a little salt and pepper and saute the veggies for 4-5 minutes.",
    "⁠Add the sauces and mix well. Then add the rice and top with spring onions.",
    "⁠Cook for 2 minutes and its ready!"
  ],
